# Worldwide AI OS: the settings the workspace on this computer needs. This file is an example and has no values.
#
# At first boot they are entered on this computer and kept in /etc/worldwide-ai/settings.env, readable only by root and
# the worldwide-ai service. They are never put in the installer image, and never shown again after they are saved.
#
# The workspace's database, storage, model key and the rest are the same settings as on the website: see .env.example in
# the source and docs/worldwide-ai.md. Give this computer the narrowest access that works.

# WORLDWIDE_AI_OWNER_EMAILS=
# WORLDWIDE_AI_STAFF_EMAILS=
# POSTGRES_URL=
# SUPABASE_URL=
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
